\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Block-Diagonal R-Matrix on Gene Ontology datasets (4 datasets, 3,500--4,200 classes). Dense R is infeasible on GPU ($>$65~MB matrix). Sparse R reconciliation is applied at inference time only; training uses identity matrix to avoid OOM. AUPRC improves on all datasets.}}{13}{table.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
